rooms_desc ({"You stand in the entry hall of a tiny house.The house belongs to the mighty mage Wicki, the tiny one.It looks very peaceful. The birds are chirping in the windows.Tiny white clouds move through the room.The sun shines warmly through the glass roof.If you are peaceful, you are warmly welcomed.","You are in the living room of the lovely house.The windows show you several beatiful landscapes.A large couch stands infront of the south wallOn the north wall you see a cupboard and a small desk.On the desk stands a magic ball with some buttons.","This is the lab in the house of Wicki.Dark clouds moves through the room.A big oaken table stands in the midle of the room.Some potions lay on the table.A big rat lurks in a corner.","You feel small in this large room.In the center stand a very long table. It is covered with dishes.You smell the best an most delicious food you have ever seen.You cannot stand the gruble in your stomach.So you tear off some of the good-looking dragon rips.Suddenly (with a blob) the rip appeared again on the huge steamed dragon.","This is the Austrian Room in Wickis House.All is furnished in German.Hier stehen schoene alte Sesserl in einem grossen Plueschteppich.Am Nachkasterl steht ein alter Blumentopf.En grosses Bett steht in der Mitte.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.",})
